On October 29, 1837, he was born as the seventh son of Nariaki TOKUGAWA, the ninth lord of the Mito Domain in Koishikawa, Edo.
His mother was the lawful wife of Princess Yoshiko (the third Shogun Iemitsu TOKUGAWA), who was the lawful wife of Iemitsu TOKUGAWA.
However, it is said that Iemitsu's real mother was Oe no kata, the lawful wife of his father Hidetada, but there is a theory that she was her real mother.
